         <gmd:abstract>
            <gco:CharacterString>Census REST files provide a way for users to request TIGER\Line information from Census GIS servers files through Representational
                                 State Transfer (REST)technology. Clients issue requests to the server through structured URLs. The server responds with map images,
                                 text-based geographic information, or other resources that satisfy the request.
                                                         
                                 The 2016 Urban Areas REST File contains Urbanized Areas, Urban Clusters; January 1, 2010 vintage. This Rest service contains data as of
                                 January 1,2016.
            </gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:abstract>
         <gmd:purpose>
            <gco:CharacterString>To provide a way for users to request TIGER\Line information from Census GIS servers files through Representational State Transfer
                                 (REST)technology.</gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:purpose>
